    <div class="intro-content">
        <div class="page-width">
            <div class="has-left-card">
                <div class="intro-content-inner">
                    <div class="dis-left">
                        <p>
                           At JasonL, we're not just another retailer shipping boxes from interstate - we set up in Adelaide because SA businesses deserve better service, better speed, and real local support. Our <a href="https://goo.gl/maps/rtYHqHkxroRRdSPU6" target="_blank" data-ga4="location_engagement" direction_location="Adelaide City showroom">Grote Street showroom</a> lets you see and try everything in person, with real people ready to help - no guesswork and no long waits.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dis-right">
                        <p>
                            Whether you're a startup, government team, or family business, we make fitouts simple: layouts, product selection, installation, and fast local delivery. We're proud to be part of Adelaide, working with local trades and supporting South Australian projects every day.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
